02/58-df-zfc-model-type-realization.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10RealizedType}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10RealizedType}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}realized\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10RealizedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcModelTypeRealization}_S\n(\\langle a\\rangle,p,\\mathcal M,L,1)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}realized\\text{-}type}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10RealizedType}_S(p,\\mathcal M,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcModelTypeRealization}_S\n(\\langle a\\rangle,p,\\mathcal M,L,1)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The one-variable case is an exact specialization of the canonical finite-tuple realization predicate, which already binds the satisfaction recursion, assignment, language, and free-variable guard.</li>\n<li>The model5 realized-type variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model-type-realization.md","status":"resolved","id":"e721d6de164f106d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-model-type-realization.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-model-type-realization.md","status":"resolved